---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-border font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Shopify style) -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-8 sm:mb-10 pb-5 border-b border-border gap-4">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary block mb-1">
          Jasa Pembuatan Greenhouse
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-dark tracking-tight mb-2">
          Greenhouse yang Dirancang Sesuai Lahan, Komoditas &amp; Anggaran
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted font-normal leading-relaxed">
          Pembuatan greenhouse sebaiknya tidak dimulai hanya dari pemilihan rangka. Ukuran lahan, kondisi angin, jenis tanaman, ventilasi, material penutup, sistem irigasi, serta target penggunaan perlu dipertimbangkan sejak awal. Agrokomplek Cemerlang menyediakan beberapa pilihan konstruksi greenhouse:
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/#kalkulator"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-hover transition-colors shrink-0"
      >
        <span>Kalkulator RAB Online</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Greenhouse Types Technical Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 sm:gap-6 mb-12 sm:mb-14">
      
      <!-- Type 1: Bambu -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-white border border-border hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-hover hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo (clean, no overlay) -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-secondary/50 border border-border/60 mb-4">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-bambu.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Rangka Bambu Agrokomplek Cemerlang"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/70 mb-2.5">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary">Tipe 01 &bull; Bambu</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted bg-secondary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Investasi Terjangkau
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark mb-1.5 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Bambu
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pilihan ekonomis untuk kebun yang membutuhkan bangunan pelindung tanaman dengan investasi awal lebih terjangkau.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted border-t border-border/70 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Cocok untuk:</span> Sayuran, Cabai, Tomat, Melon, Nursery, Kebun skala kecil &amp; menengah</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Rangka:</span> Bambu pilihan</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Atap:</span> Plastik UV / Paranet</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-border/70">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Bambu."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:text-primary-hover flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Greenhouse Bambu</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 2: Galvanis (Paling Populer) -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-primary/60 hover:border-primary shadow-xs hover:shadow-hover hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 p-5 relative">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo (clean, no overlay) -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-secondary/50 border border-border/60 mb-4">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-galvanis.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Pipa Galvanis Komersial"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/70 mb-2.5">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary">Tipe 02 &bull; Terpopuler</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold bg-peach text-primary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Komersial Permanen
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark mb-1.5 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Pipa Galvanis
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pilihan untuk kebutuhan budidaya yang mengutamakan struktur lebih permanen dan penggunaan jangka panjang.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted border-t border-border/70 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Cocok untuk:</span> Melon premium, Paprika, Stroberi, Anggur, Hidroponik, Kebun komersial</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Rangka:</span> Pipa Galvanis anti karat</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Desain:</span> Disesuaikan ukuran lahan, ventilasi, insect net &amp; irigasi</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-border/70">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Pipa%20Galvanis."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:text-primary-hover flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Greenhouse Galvanis</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 3: Baja Ringan -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-white border border-border hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-hover hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo (clean, no overlay) -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-secondary/50 border border-border/60 mb-4">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/greenhouse-baja-ringan.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Greenhouse Rangka Baja Ringan"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/70 mb-2.5">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary">Tipe 03 &bull; Modular</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted bg-secondary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Pemasangan Praktis
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark mb-1.5 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Greenhouse Baja Ringan
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Alternatif struktur modular dengan proses pemasangan relatif praktis untuk beberapa jenis nursery dan budidaya modern.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted border-t border-border/70 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Cocok untuk:</span> Nursery, Sayuran, Selada, Stroberi, Hidroponik</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Rangka:</span> Baja Ringan Zincalume</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Kelebihan:</span> Bobot ringan, modular, perakitan cepat</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-border/70">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Greenhouse%20Baja%20Ringan."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:text-primary-hover flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Baja Ringan</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Type 4: Tunnel Garam -->
      <div class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-white border border-border hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-hover hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 p-5">
        <div>
          <!-- Photo (clean, no overlay) -->
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-secondary/50 border border-border/60 mb-4">
            <img
              src="/images/greenhouse/tunnel-garam-greenhouse.webp"
              alt="Konstruksi Tunnel Garam Prisma Pesisir"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/70 mb-2.5">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary">Tipe 04 &bull; Khusus</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-muted bg-secondary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Tahan Cuaca Pesisir
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-dark mb-1.5 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Tunnel Garam
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Konstruksi tunnel untuk membantu melindungi proses produksi dan kristalisasi garam dari perubahan cuaca.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted border-t border-border/70 pt-3">
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Cocok untuk:</span> Meja kristalisasi garam, lahan tambak pesisir</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Rangka:</span> Bambu awet / Pipa lengkung tahan garam</p>
            <p><span class="font-semibold text-dark">Desain:</span> Disesuaikan kondisi lokasi &amp; produksi</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-border/70">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20pembuatan%20Tunnel%20Garam."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs font-bold text-primary group-hover:text-primary-hover flex items-center justify-between transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Konsultasi Tunnel Garam</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Callout Box: Bingung Menentukan Jenis Greenhouse? Hitung Kebutuhan & Estimasi Anggaran Lebih Awal -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-dark text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-md relative overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
      <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 block">Bingung Menentukan Jenis Greenhouse?</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
          Hitung Kebutuhan &amp; Estimasi Anggaran Lebih Awal
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Harga pembuatan greenhouse dipengaruhi oleh banyak faktor, antara lain: luas bangunan, jenis rangka, spesifikasi plastik UV, kebutuhan insect net, sistem ventilasi, kondisi lokasi, pondasi, sistem irigasi, serta kebutuhan instalasi lainnya. Gunakan Kalkulator RAB Greenhouse untuk mendapatkan gambaran awal kebutuhan proyek Anda.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
        <a
          href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/#kalkulator"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-normal transition-all shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          <span>Hitung Estimasi Greenhouse</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/6285183002070?text=Halo%20Agrokomplek%20Cemerlang,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20RAB%20dan%20ukuran%20lahan%20greenhouse."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-normal transition-all border border-white/20"
        >
          <span>Konsultasi RAB via WhatsApp</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
